# 0.1.2: the parse is split out of load() so the config kit's reload routines (reloadAll / reloadSkills / reloadLimits, run by the kit
# after its atomic write, on the save task, outside every kit lock) only PARSE - they never write config.properties (the kit owns every
# write after setup). Clamps and defaults are exactly 0.1.1's. Two alignments: onlineMessages reads false/off/no/0 as OFF (the kit's bool
# words; 0.1.1: only "false"), and an xpSkills line that is missing or empty gives the default list on a reload too (0.1.1 kept the
